1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,060
Today your Python talks to the outside world.

2
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:05,427
A REST API is how tools,

3
00:00:05,427 --> 00:00:08,909
clouds and servers answer questions over HTTP.

4
00:00:08,909 --> 00:00:12,694
Three habits make your calls safe: authentication,

5
00:00:12,694 --> 00:00:13,376
timeouts,

6
00:00:13,376 --> 00:00:14,511
and pagination.

7
00:00:15,061 --> 00:00:18,637
Every demo is typed live on Ubuntu twenty-four oh four,

8
00:00:18,637 --> 00:00:21,952
against a small lab API that runs on this computer.

9
00:00:24,002 --> 00:00:28,482
A REST API is a web address that answers with data, usually JSON.

10
00:00:29,032 --> 00:00:34,771
You ask with a method. GET reads data. POST creates data. And you get back a status code.

11
00:00:35,321 --> 00:00:36,928
Two hundred means success.

12
00:00:36,928 --> 00:00:39,400
Four oh one means you are not logged in.

13
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:42,553
Five hundred and up means the server has a problem.

14
00:00:43,103 --> 00:00:46,964
Python's requests library turns this into three lines of code.

15
00:00:47,514 --> 00:00:50,965
But real APIs need three habits: prove who you are,

16
00:00:50,965 --> 00:00:52,251
never wait forever,

17
00:00:52,251 --> 00:00:53,807
and ask for every page.

18
00:00:55,857 --> 00:01:00,380
First, a simple call. Start Python. Type: python three, dash Q.

19
00:01:01,230 --> 00:01:03,171
Import the requests library.

20
00:01:03,171 --> 00:01:06,222
It is installed in this virtual environment,

21
00:01:06,222 --> 00:01:08,024
with pip install requests.

22
00:01:08,024 --> 00:01:09,550
Type: import requests.

23
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:13,112
Now call the health address of our lab API.

24
00:01:13,112 --> 00:01:14,583
Always set a timeout.

25
00:01:14,583 --> 00:01:15,143
Type: r,

26
00:01:15,143 --> 00:01:15,634
equals,

27
00:01:15,634 --> 00:01:16,825
requests dot get,

28
00:01:16,825 --> 00:01:17,735
open bracket,

29
00:01:17,735 --> 00:01:19,276
the address in quotes,

30
00:01:19,276 --> 00:01:23,900
H T T P colon slash slash one two seven dot zero dot zero dot one,

31
00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:25,791
colon eight zero eight one,

32
00:01:25,791 --> 00:01:26,702
slash health,

33
