timeout equals five,

35
00:01:28,874 --> 00:01:29,854
close bracket.

36
00:01:30,404 --> 00:01:31,536
Nothing printed,

37
00:01:31,536 --> 00:01:33,376
the answer is stored in r.

38
00:01:33,376 --> 00:01:35,074
Ask for the status code.

39
00:01:35,074 --> 00:01:37,551
Type: r dot status underscore code.

40
00:01:38,101 --> 00:01:43,114
Two hundred, success. Now the data. Type: r dot jay son, open, close.

41
00:01:43,664 --> 00:01:49,275
A Python dictionary, already decoded. Leave Python. Type: exit, open, close.

42
00:01:49,825 --> 00:01:54,454
A status code, and JSON. Get, check, decode. That is the whole pattern.

43
00:01:56,504 --> 00:01:58,330
Most API s need a token.

44
00:01:58,330 --> 00:02:01,221
We keep it in an environment variable,

45
00:02:01,221 --> 00:02:02,590
never in the code.

46
00:02:02,590 --> 00:02:08,600
Type: export API underscore T O K E N equals lab dash token dash one two three.

47
00:02:09,150 --> 00:02:11,359
That is a throwaway lab token,

48
00:02:11,359 --> 00:02:13,421
published in the repository.

49
00:02:13,421 --> 00:02:16,219
A real token is never typed on screen.

50
00:02:16,219 --> 00:02:17,177
Start Python.

51
00:02:17,177 --> 00:02:18,576
Type: python three,

52
00:02:18,576 --> 00:02:19,091
dash Q.

53
00:02:19,941 --> 00:02:24,571
Import O S and requests. Type: import O S, comma, requests.

54
