Store the address of the servers list.

55
00:02:27,945 --> 00:02:28,837
Type: U R L,

56
00:02:28,837 --> 00:02:29,357
equals,

57
00:02:29,357 --> 00:02:30,992
the address in quotes,

58
00:02:30,992 --> 00:02:35,897
H T T P colon slash slash one two seven dot zero dot zero dot one,

59
00:02:35,897 --> 00:02:37,904
colon eight zero eight one,

60
00:02:37,904 --> 00:02:38,945
slash servers.

61
00:02:39,495 --> 00:02:39,950
First,

62
00:02:39,950 --> 00:02:41,618
call it with no token.

63
00:02:41,618 --> 00:02:43,362
Type: requests dot get,

64
00:02:43,362 --> 00:02:44,348
open bracket,

65
00:02:44,348 --> 00:02:44,803
U R L,

66
00:02:44,803 --> 00:02:45,258
comma,

67
00:02:45,258 --> 00:02:46,775
timeout equals five,

68
00:02:46,775 --> 00:02:47,836
close bracket,

69
00:02:47,836 --> 00:02:49,884
dot status underscore code.

70
00:02:50,434 --> 00:02:52,387
Four oh one: not authorized.

71
00:02:52,387 --> 00:02:53,991
The server wants proof.

72
00:02:53,991 --> 00:02:57,548
Build a header with the token from the environment.

73
00:02:57,548 --> 00:02:58,106
Type: h,

74
00:02:58,106 --> 00:02:58,594
equals,

75
00:02:58,594 --> 00:02:59,012
brace,

76
00:02:59,012 --> 00:03:00,826
quote Authorization quote,

77
00:03:00,826 --> 00:03:01,244
colon,

78
00:03:01,244 --> 00:03:02,151
quote Bearer,

79
00:03:02,151 --> 00:03:02,569
space,

80
00:03:02,569 --> 00:03:02,988
quote,

81
00:03:02,988 --> 00:03:03,337
plus,

82
00:03:03,337 --> 00:03:04,452
O S dot environ,

83
00:03:04,452 --> 00:03:05,499
square bracket,

84
00:03:05,499 --> 00:03:08,079
quote API underscore T O K E N quote,

85
00:03:08,079 --> 00:03:09,544
close square bracket,

86
00:03:09,544 --> 00:03:10,381
close brace.

87
00:03:10,931 --> 00:03:12,034
Now call again,

88
00:03:12,034 --> 00:03:13,211
with the header.

89
00:03:13,211 --> 00:03:14,903
Type: requests dot get,

90
00:03:14,903 --> 00:03:15,859
open bracket,

91
00:03:15,859 --> 00:03:16,300
U R L,

92
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:16,741
comma,

93
00:03:16,741 --> 00:03:17,992
headers equals h,

94
00:03:17,992 --> 00:03:18,433
comma,

95
00:03:18,433 --> 00:03:19,904
timeout equals five,

96
00:03:19,904 --> 00:03:20,934
close bracket,

97
00:03:20,934 --> 00:03:22,920
dot status underscore code.

98
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:24,283
Two hundred,

99
00:03:24,283 --> 00:03:24,960
we are in.

100
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:27,738
How many servers does the API say it has?

101
00:03:27,738 --> 00:03:29,093
Type: the same call,

102
00:03:29,093 --> 00:03:30,245
then dot jay son,

103
00:03:30,245 --> 00:03:30,584
open,

104
00:03:30,584 --> 00:03:30,990
close,

105
00:03:30,990 --> 00:03:32,006
square bracket,

106
00:03:32,006 --> 00:03:33,226
quote total quote,

107
00:03:33,226 --> 00:03:34,649
close square bracket.

108
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:35,998
Ten servers.

109
00:03:35,998 --> 00:03:39,128
Authentication is a header named Authorization,

110
00:03:39,128 --> 00:03:40,526
with the word Bearer,

111
00:03:40,526 --> 00:03:41,059
a space,

112
00:03:41,059 --> 00:03:41,991
and the token.

113
00:03:41,991 --> 00:03:44,456
The token comes from the environment,

114
00:03:44,456 --> 00:03:47,785
so it never sits in your code or your git history.

115
00:03:49,835 --> 00:03:50,214
Next,

116
00:03:50,214 --> 00:03:50,897
timeouts.

117
00:03:50,897 --> 00:03:51,808
Without one,

118
00:03:51,808 --> 00:03:55,299
your script can hang forever on a slow server.

119
00:03:55,299 --> 00:03:56,589
Here is a script,

120
00:03:56,589 --> 00:03:57,803
timeout dot P Y.

121
00:03:57,803 --> 00:03:59,776
Type: cat timeout dot P Y.

122
00:04:00,326 --> 00:04:02,084
It calls the slow address,

123
00:04:02,084 --> 00:04:04,383
which answers after three seconds,

124
00:04:04,383 --> 00:04:05,803
but we only wait one.

125
00:04:05,803 --> 00:04:08,170
If that fails with a Timeout error,

126
00:04:08,170 --> 00:04:09,860
we print a clear message.

127
00:04:09,860 --> 00:04:10,333
Run it.

128
00:04:10,333 --> 00:04:11,618
Type: python three,

129
00:04:11,618 --> 00:04:12,700
timeout dot P Y.

130
00:04:16,750 --> 00:04:18,806
It gave up after one second,

131
00:04:18,806 --> 00:04:20,201
instead of hanging.

132
00:04:20,201 --> 00:04:21,891
Now allow five seconds,

133
00:04:21,891 --> 00:04:22,552
